    </introduction>
    <task>
      <statement>
        <p>Compute the average total energy used in a day in kilowatt-hours (kWh).</p>
      </statement>
    </task>
    <task>
      <statement>
        <p>If a ton of coal generates <m>1842</m> kWh, how long does it take for an average residence to burn a ton of coal?</p>
      </statement>
    </task>
    <task>
      <statement>
        <p>Explain why the data might fit a plot of the form <m>p(t) = 11.5 - 7.5\sin\left(\frac{\pi t}{12}\right)</m>.</p>
      </statement>
    </task>
  </exercise>

